A column-zero marker below an open div attaches beside the div

```
- ::: d
+
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="d">

    </div>
    tail
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- - ::: d
  +
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="d">

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    +
tail
  </li>
</ul>
```

